{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification enforces strict safety: never move forward into a front obstacle, always recover by rotating clockwise, and resume exploration as soon as the path is clear. Only rotate_clockwise is used for turning and recovery. All obstacle events force explicit recovery, and forward progress is prioritized when safe.",
  "strategy": [
    "Plant G1 models the robot's motion subsystem with move_forward and rotate_clockwise as controllable events.",
    "Spec E1 encodes the exploration supervisor: move_forward only when clear, rotate_clockwise for any obstacle, and return to exploration immediately after path_clear."
  ],
